# Python bytecode from the generators (gen_ans.py and friends).
# __pycache__/gen_ans.cpython-314.pyc was tracked, which is how a build artefact
# tied to one interpreter version ended up in history: a .pyc is regenerated on
# every import and says nothing a reader needs.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
